Package: buzzard-search
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Open Research Tools <maintainers@openresearchtools.org>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-requests, python3-defusedxml (>= 0.7.1)
Description: reusable private SearXNG search service for Buzzard applications
 Provides a per-user SearXNG service, JSON CLI and stdio MCP interface for
 Wild Buzzard, Buzzard Agent and other local applications.
